st...<br><br><strong>Run, Climb, Slide, and Crawl Your Way to Safety!</strong><br>Toing's Pops 2 introduces new movement to bring a fast pace, and exciting experience to the game. Use these to your advantage in your attempt to save yourself and your friend.",
